1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,745
Too broad and no one feels spoken to.

2
00:00:02,745 --> 00:00:05,148
Too narrow and you cannot find anyone.

3
00:00:05,148 --> 00:00:08,236
This lesson is about niche vs broad first offer.

4
00:00:08,236 --> 00:00:10,982
Narrow enough to sell, wide enough to find.

5
00:00:10,982 --> 00:00:13,384
Do not treat this as theory only.

6
00:00:13,384 --> 00:00:16,815
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

7
00:00:16,815 --> 00:00:21,963
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

8
00:00:21,963 --> 00:00:25,738
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

9
00:00:25,738 --> 00:00:29,856
Stay practical: write a niche sentence before you optimize branding or tools.

10
00:00:30,176 --> 00:00:34,723
First offer: narrow enough to sell, wide enough to find twenty conversations.

11
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:37,376
Remember the objective: write a niche sentence.

12
